name: Generated boundary context through finite discovery, triage, report and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 context:build indexed 4 files | source-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-generated-root.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned accepted root context
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | root-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
keys: Space Down Space p Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engine-choice
keys: m Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space a Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE CONTEXT | boundary-context
keys: Down Down o Up Enter g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE FILE-GROUP CONTEXT | generate-boundary-context
expect: Boundary: app
expect: One file-group context job
keys: t
type: 9
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | one-context-job
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART context-draft
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | approve-context
expect: 1 fixed jobs
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved context job | context-approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 L starts the approved jobs | fixed-context-job
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | context-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART context-finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | context-complete
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | context-restarted
paste-file: @ART/generated-context-resume.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 FILE-GROUP CONTEXT DRAFT | recovered-context
expect: 1 committed / 9
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspect-generated-context
expect: Owned group component
expect: Source matched at inspection.
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 FILE-GROUP CONTEXT RECEIPT | source-receipt
expect: supplied excerpts: 3
expect: 2 discovery · 1 shared-context files
ask: Does the generated context disclose its exact source membership, inherited revision, source limits and omissions without implying complete repository coverage?
keys: Home v
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | generated-dfd
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT SUMMARY | return-generated-context
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for app | local-context-selected
expect: app · exact override
expect: other · omitted
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | recovered-scope-draft
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Scope draft ready | six-job-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | shared-allowance
expect: 6 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 9
expect: Protected review calls: 2
keys: End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | approve-six-jobs
ask: Does this separate approval disclose six discovery jobs and shared spending while keeping sibling omission and follow-up work outside approval?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Approval saved | scans-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-scan-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | scans-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 6 completed | scans-completed
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-app.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Owned app policy observation | app-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned workflow fixture; no defect claimed
require-live-snap: 30 rejected_false_positive | app-decision
paste-file: @ART/open-other.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Owned other policy observation | other-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned workflow fixture; no defect claimed
require-live-snap: 30 rejected_false_positive | other-decision
submit: report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
require-live-snap: 30 Scope study: | investigation-report
expect: Scope study: 2 boundaries · 1 unplanned
expect: 7 committed / 9 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
keys: j j j Enter End
require-live-snap: 30 json · 2 finding(s) | report-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: p Home
resize: 160x48
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-12-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-13-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-14-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-15-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-16-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-17-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-18-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: report-tail-40x12
ask: Across terminal sizes, can the operator read both context choices, receipt limits, recurrence and shared spending without confusing report controls with context-reader shortcuts?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
resize: 80x24
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | final-restart
submit: report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report-frame
require-live-snap: 30 Scope study: | recovered-report
expect: 7 committed / 9 calls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_scope_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart preserve the fixed study, exact generated context, explicit omission, decisions, export and accounting without another request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
